{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：09:00 2026-11-19 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7fca8ed0a0479a79fefbffeb1f0d7ab7/2026-11/LUXESTYLE_2023_KFTemplates__4.jpg\"/>\n<p>近期時尚圈大吹「回憶殺」與「可愛風」，多個國際品牌不約而同與經典卡通或傳奇飲品推出驚喜聯乘，將滿滿童趣與復古情懷穿戴上身！無論是把萌爆Monchhichi躍上經典袋款、將Snoopy融入美式學院風外套，又或以Coca-Cola化作服飾上的華麗串珠刺繡，三大話題聯乘新作各具特色，為日常造型增添亮眼焦點！</p>\n<h2>MCM x Monchhichi 潮萌玩味時尚</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c5ea73c6a790785e8acf5a0e0ba867b/2026-11/MCM_x_Monchhichi_Event_Image_-_Freen_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf7b66e5287676b89dbc82a8c68f79b0/2026-11/MCM_x_Monchhichi_Event_Image_-_Freen_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/01bae2785050922502154368f44a6bba/2026-11/MCM_x_Monchhichi_Event_Image_-_Freen_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c46959bb75ca2395291bb0afd000803a/2026-11/MCM_x_Monchhichi_Event_Image_-_Freen_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/018e61321ba2866683df5a4f4037fbcd/2026-11/MCM_x_Monchhichi_Event_Image_-_Freen_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a695b3c8d6c068f7f5350418cb7994b9/2026-11/MCM_x_Monchhichi_Event_Image_-_Marf_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4fd739fe776a20b935fd1ebef6328f19/2026-11/MCM_x_Monchhichi_Event_Image_-_Marf_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a363a971552de4ff499b0f4ccec79ba/2026-11/MCM_x_Monchhichi_Event_Image_-_Marf_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9cc3caa47ce39d4fb4aab0ebc4086505/2026-11/MCM_x_Monchhichi_Event_Image_-_Marf_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"MCM×Monchhichi系列Liz Shopping Bag/$6,500。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf4ebe4478189533648c228cd76849ad/2026-11/MCMxMCHH_2408202633952.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"MCM×Monchhichi系列Aren單肩長形手 袋/$6,100。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f448a7e4ba7eb6f8c179c2b9e5f013ec/2026-11/MCMxMCHH_2408202633972.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\" MCM×Monchhichi系列Aren Vanity Bag/$5,400。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e5c12acee4c57ce785172c689c6f661/2026-11/MCMxMCHH_2408202634280.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"MCM X MONCCHICHI系列 Toni  Tote Bag/$5,800。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7fc2514ba3054ffc7105f494d205099f/2026-11/MWPGAMT06CO001_01.jpg\"/>\n<p>德國時尚皮具品牌MCM與日本經典玩偶Monchhichi驚喜碰頭，帶來充滿童趣與懷舊魅力的限量聯乘系列。早前Marf與泰國女星Freen一同出席MCM X Monchhichi系列發布活動，演繹萌爆可愛新袋款。這次合作以玩味十足的視角，重新演繹品牌標誌性的干邑色Visetos印花圖案，同時將饒富質感的皮革、招牌金色金屬配件，與Monchhichi可愛萌趣的細節互相融合，為奢華街頭時尚注入滿滿的治癒氣息。此系列包羅4款人氣經典袋款，分別是實用百搭的Liz Shopping Bag與Toni Tote Bag，還有小巧精緻且復古的Aren單肩長形手袋及大熱的Vanity Bag，每款單品既保留品牌工藝與經典輪廓，亦不失童趣，適合日常配搭之餘，又是值得粉絲收藏，令人愛不釋手！</p>\n<h2>Brooks Brothers×PEANUTS New Ivy休閒格調</h2>\n<img alt=\"藍白拼色復古棒球外套/$2,890。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a1ca3403e97baad256141973012a5eb/2026-11/BB534-BB_x_Peanuts_Social_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩款飾以Snoopy刺繡圖案的棒球帽/各$590。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f22ae1124505ba212ea5a4d4418e5d79/2026-11/BB534-BB_x_Peanuts_Social_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"牛津紡鈕扣領恤衫/各$1,390。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2343bf693ccbae717fef32d69edf6f8c/2026-11/BB534-BB_x_Peanuts_Social_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"開襟針織外套胸前飾以徽章刺繡/$2,190。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cde2dadfc40249f0a3a2a223cadf078d/2026-11/BB534-BB_x_Peanuts_Social_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"帆布棒球帽 /$590、Tote Bag/$1,890、橫間T恤/$890。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e61f8867bafac71dbec8fb369a3021c7/2026-11/BB534-BB_x_Peanuts_Social_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"半拉鏈運動衛衣/$1,590。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/785bc4e8cbaf372167fb5199774b887d/2026-11/BB800001186Q3_1_.jpg\"/>\n<p>美國百年服飾品牌Brooks Brothers今次與PEANUTS推出秋冬聯名系列，以品牌經典單品為核心，結合刺繡、復古提花、嵌花編織與人字紋等工藝，透過招牌版型、舒適剪裁與活潑圖案，展現休閒的New Ivy風格。系列延續Brooks Brothers 1818經典花體標誌，搭配細緻的鎖鏈刺繡工藝。當中人字紋西裝外套、費爾島圖騰針織衫、Oxford Shirt等經典單品換上全新面貌。外套款式包括人字紋粗花呢西裝外套、卡其色哈靈頓外套，以及藍白拼色復古棒球外套。利落剪裁搭配花生主角Snoopy刺繡徽章或低調暗紋，適合任何場合輕鬆穿搭。藍白條紋及純白T恤簡約清爽，巧妙融入史努比與胡士托的可愛身影，為日常造型增添童趣。同系列亦有推出棒球帽及Tote Bag，可隨意Mix &amp; Match。</p>\n<h2>ALICE + OLIVIA by Stacey Bendet×Coca Cola 投入美式世界</h2>\n<img alt=\"「Serve Ice Cold」Kayla閃爍串珠刺繡手袋/$595。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc1c4fbe18dec3c0051a85cf0492364a/2026-11/ALICE_OLIVIA_22-10-2026_03_997.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"色彩繽紛的蓬鬆剪裁半截長裙/$23,150，綴以汽水瓶圖案與花花串珠刺繡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5faa218eafc86ff371801a749846dd1b/2026-11/ALICE_OLIVIA_22-10-2026_06_1792.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Bradley Staceface針織外套 /$695，以美麗諾羊毛製成， 綴以繽紛布章刺繡、復古Coca-Cola圖案與趣味綴飾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/784c2e10d8056286ca9e6eaf7836cf95/2026-11/BRADLEY_STACEFACE_CARDIGAN_695_CV611000037K135_06.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"EVE Embell Sweetheart連身裙/$1,795。 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf55239f8e606981ca0a098daa53a2db/2026-11/EVE_EMBELL_SWEETHEART_MINI_DRESS_1795_CV611000021AC008_06.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"雙縐真絲Willa Staceface 白恤衫/$3,150，圖案完 美將兩個品牌精髓融合。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e99b3e6927ad6bdbc4ccd625b393ea4c/2026-11/WILLA_STACEFACE_PLKT_TOP_.jpg\"/>\n<p>這個獨家聯乘膠囊系列完美地融合兩個品牌的美式風格。聯乘系列共有19款單品，包括恤衫、牛仔褲、T恤及連身裙等，ALICE + OLIVIA by Stacey Bendet的優雅女性氣質與可口可樂的悠久傳承一拍即合。其中Willa Staceface恤衫，隱藏式前襟設計令品牌標誌性的Staceface圖案更見突出。另貫徹品牌Glam風格，模特兒穿上的半截<br/>長裙綴滿色彩繽紛的汽水瓶圖案，豐富多姿的串珠刺繡閃爍耀目，極具高訂服的華麗氣派，正是高街時尚混搭的最佳示範。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:24:00.324415+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1205,"images":25,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T01:00:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:57:30.981196+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T01:17:36.408583+00:00","content_hash":"946a48451d49fab6bdb62cc6542b574b00b6fb83c33c85bf6b1439530b187f6e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}